cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PoseTag, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PoseTag: End-to-End Pipeline for Ground-Truth 6-DoF Pose Collection from RGB"
authors:
  - family-names: "Adebayo"
    given-names: "Samuel"
repository-code: "https://github.com/exponentialR/posetag"
url: "https://github.com/exponentialR/posetag"
abstract: "PoseTag is scientific Python software for generating reproducible ground-truth 6-DoF object poses from RGB using AprilTags, camera calibration, per-face board definitions, and Intel RealSense, webcam, or video capture."
keywords:
  - 6-DoF pose estimation
  - AprilTags
  - computer vision
  - ground-truth annotation
  - robotics
  - camera calibration
  - scientific software
